2004) — Marlon  \n- **Almost Christmas** (2016) — Malachi  \n- **Traffik** (2018) — John  \n- **Trick** (2019) — Detective Mike Denver  \n- **3022** (2019) — John Laine  \n- **Fatal Affair** (2020) — David Hammond  \n- **The Devil You Know** (2022) — Marcus Cowans  \n- **The Deliverance** (2024) — Melvin  \n- **Moses the Black** (2026) — Malik  \n\nSome of his best-known films are **Juice**, **Higher Learning**, **The Wood**, **In Too Deep**, and **Love & Basketball**. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omar_Epps?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "What movies is Omar Epps in?\n", "asr_s": 3.02, "expert_s": 7.43, "expert_input_samples": 31190, "expert_input_s": 1.949, "expert_input_sha256": "bff9d88af3865850a90810116df0b104495a1c54d7d21bb01c93931ed9d0c690", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 0.0, "relay_synth_ms": 19550, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 20, "feed_lag_max_ms": 2169, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 7397, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0001_balanced_relay.wav", "sha256": "c30f36329e3e0a855070f102a3ad8ba9f61cc2963a5493203bdcb1890ac90b57", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 46.64}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0001_balanced_candidate.wav", "sha256": "5bfa7cf9e39c79db19889c351f5aa46c65ec85057d081bac888c873e5746541b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0001_balanced_stall.wav", "sha256": "be6cafd8624c6d714bcd1d8d5a9af0935edb1354ab2143dc42f736b1c0b8143e", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 21.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.054, 1.098, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.949, 2.005, 2.049, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.949, 3.005, 3.05, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.949, 4.006, 4.534, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.949, 7.178, 7.803, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.949, 7.86, 8.436, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.949, 8.497, 8.983, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.949, 9.055, 9.561, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.949, 9.623, 10.194, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.949, 10.268, 10.755, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.949, 1