{"id": "swebq0202", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3557486182, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "452ae3d391103874253b2612ca88a459fb34e3c2c0d46a5f0ea415086d584f74", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "where are kohler sinks manufactured?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0202.wav", "input_sha256": "00a8559ac79e32d95401314b7e9eba5f0ddefe485419b77447bfd74899989b1f", "input_samples": 41592, "input_s": 2.599, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.904, "act": 0.9992, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Kohler sinks are manufactured in multiple countries, depending on the specific model and material. So the most accurate answer is: check the specific sink model or packaging, because Kohler sinks are not all manufactured in one place.", "expert_answer": "Kohler sinks are manufactured in **multiple countries**, depending on the specific model and material. Kohler is a global company with manufacturing facilities worldwide.\n\n- Some Kohler sinks—especially **enameled cast iron** and certain **Artist Editions/glass sinks**—are made in **Kohler, Wisconsin, USA**.\n- Other sink models may be made in countries such as **China, Mexico, India, or elsewhere**, depending on the product line.\n- Kohler says the country of origin is usually printed on the box label as **“Crafted in [country]”** below the UPC.\n\nSo the most accurate answer is: **check the specific sink model or packaging**, because Kohler sinks are not all manufactured in one place.", "transcript": "Where are Kohler sinks manufactured?\n", "asr_s": 0.41, "expert_s": 5.37, "expert_input_samples": 41592, "expert_input_s": 2.599, "expert_input_sha256": "00a8559ac79e32d95401314b7e9eba5f0ddefe485419b77447bfd74899989b1f", "expert_timed_out": 